      "text": "\u00a7 6. Medically unfit drivers. All Departments and Agencies shall make every effort to continue the employment, in appropriate positions, consonant with the public welfare, of drivers of motor vehicles who are found to be medically unfit to perform the duties of the position on the basis of the medical re-examination. In accordance with this policy, first priority and preferred action shall be as follows:",
